{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/1785d08a1a6ccc6.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>一名居住在泰國曼谷的日本網民轉發了這個關於2025年全球空調產量的推文，並配文調侃道：「本以為在空調產量上泰國能和中國一較高下，結果看到這張圖表（笑哭）」。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/f3ed954983e947d.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>仔細看圖，中國的產品是2.09億台，柱狀圖繞了一圈半，直接變成了圖表的邊框了。與世界第二泰國（2200萬台）之間有着巨大的產能差距。</p>\n<p>這種差距引發了日本網民的熱議，最後日本網民也不得不服氣地承認：不愧是世界工廠。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/6106aa17200664d.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>我還以為是圖表外框太醜！結果是中國的進度條</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/ae2a7ffaae10e2e.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>像拉麵碗的花紋一樣</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/9ec32312a78da49.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>嗯這是包含小型空調的數字</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/aa0c89cc98e5b08.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>那個國家果然是只要「人」多，什麼都能做得到啊！！</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/2e40a286c303435.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>還以為是表格的框框呢，笑</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/f8c92b10f2785bc.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>我上學的時候，説起中國就是「自行車王國」呢……</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1123/ba29e66c96541a4.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>不愧是世界工廠，笑</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:11:43.937842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":9,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:54:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T21:14:38.059459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:05:14.575530+00:00","content_hash":"dfd4fa50d7b49a991dadb6b3a8f0207f09c2ed9b7c9649390bda6061bafb189a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}